            "review_title": "Review at Madam Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Nina1072\nNha Trang, Vietnam88 contributions\n0\nGood location, fair price\nApr 2018 • Family\nIt's the restaurant of the Sunflower hotel (terrible) where we stayed only 1 night. It's modern and clean.\nThe food is not top quality but good value. We regretted they don't serve fresh beef with the Pho soup or in the mango salad, they use boiled beef ugh!\nThe service is a bit long and the waitresses are listless.\nGreat location though, there are many hotels and restaurant around and Tran Phu beach nearby.\nDon't stay at the hotel, very noisy and off-soundproofedl! Bad staff\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten April 25, 2018",
            "rating": 5.0,
